{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-393378-r4587432","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Christmas Cinnamon Cookies","sourcePageId":393378,"sourceRevision":"4587432","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:36:02Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Christmas%20Cinnamon%20Cookies&oldid=4587432","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:16.285Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Christmas recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes using almond","Category:Recipes using almond flour","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using powdered sugar","Category:Recipes with images"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"eb94f411c8ba131b16699c026c5fa19939c8d008acf33924e09e4eac3f15b47b","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary\n| title = Christmas biscuits\n| Category = Recipes for dessert\n| Servings = Makes 40 cookies\n| Time = Prep: 20 minutes<br>Baking:12 minutes<br>32 minutes\n| Rating = 5\n| Energy = Minimal\n| Difficulty = 2\n| Image = [[File:Christmas cookies (2).jpg|300px]]\n}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\n'''Christmas cookies''' are traditional biscuits generally used during the holiday season. These Christmas cookies are quick and easy to make and can be easily cut into any shape with cookie cutters. They make a great holiday snacks and are perfect for Christmas celebrations.\n== Ingredients ==\n* 130 [[Cookbook:Gram|grams]] (4.5 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]]) [[Cookbook:Almond Flour|almond flour]]\n* 130 grams (4.5 oz) [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], softened\n* 130 grams (4.5 oz) [[Cookbook:Powdered Sugar|powdered sugar]]\n* 300 grams (10.5 oz) [[Cookbook:Flour|wheat flour]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla extract]]\n* 2 teaspoons ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 400°F (200°C).\n# Mix all the ingredients together, in any order, to make a dough.\n# Cool dough in a refrigerator for 1 hour.\n# Flatten dough with a [[Cookbook:Rolling Pin|rolling pin]].\n# Cut out desired shapes with a [[Cookbook:Cookie Cutter|cookie cutter]].\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 10 minutes. Cool.\n== Note, tips, and variations ==\n\n* The biscuits will be soft when removed from the oven. This is normal as they will harden when they cool down. The cookies will be cooked when they appear brown on the inside and the outside.\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Very Easy recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Christmas recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Christmas Cinnamon Cookies","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"Makes 40 cookies","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"130 grams (4.5 oz) almond flour","sourceText":"130 grams (4.5 oz) almond flour","am